window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Luca 'Bones' Bonetti</b></p> <p>My rightful place is at the head of the Bonetti empire. With my father dying, the pressure is on to prove I’m the man he can trust with his legacy. He has but one stipulation. I, Luca Bonetti, certified playboy, must take a wife.</p> <p>When I find a stunning brunette attempting to steal from me, everything changes. Sweet little thief. She may be beautiful, but she chose the wrong man to mess with. I have two choices. Kill her, or use her to get what I want more than anything.</p> <p>What I hadn’t bargained for:</p> <p><i>Her refusal.</i></p> <p><i>Her little body tempting me at every turn.</i></p> <p><i>Her sassy little mouth.</i></p> <p>What she doesn’t realize is the harder she fights, the more it thrills me. I love a challenge. And breaking in my butterfly will be nothing short of exhilarating.</p>"; 
